  "description": "Call Qwen chat endpoints on DashScope, vLLM or Ollama while using the shared Mythosia.AI conversation and tool APIs. QwenService supports provider-specific thinking controls, custom deployment names, streaming usage, immutable request configuration, cancellable local tools, controllable runs and local model-capability inspection. Requires Mythosia.AI 8.2.0. What's New in v3.0.2: Completion uses the prepared request message snapshot for request context and history consistency. Public APIs, endpoint defaults and thinking controls remain unchanged. Native steering, hosted search and image generation are outside this adapter.",
